            "notes": "You could go [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) here, but I feel [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) has way more versatility here.\n\nYou could also go [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) instead of [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0), but I find using these with that bump of ability power is better for keeping everyone alive. \n\nAlso this is where things get fun, you can really begin to spam swift step to keep yourself and everyone alive. Use it to your heart's desire at this point, it always comes back.",
